# The registered american-ident1 plan (toolchain a0.0.45) spells every name
# the American way: each word of a name it lists takes the American word in
# the case it is written in, in a field, a camel-case name, an enum case, a
# local and its interpolation, a comment, a string, and a Markdown file's
# prose and ```jet fence. A longer word that only contains one, such as a
# foreign HTML attribute, stays. The old program is kept as `before.old`,
# read as a Jet source through `--source-list`. A second run finds nothing
# left to rewrite.
